7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]beads at a time until no open task beads remain.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]backlog_epic_1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/backlog_epic_1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1vn[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1vn/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]After-rebase import gate and screenshot --window safety[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]landing-safety[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]landing-safety: make the after-rebase import gate ignore virtualenv [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]files so it certifies again (sase-1un), and refuse sase screenshot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--window targets it did not launch (sase-1d9).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Green, meaningful test-cost budgets[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]test-cost[dim] · [dim][/dim]after landing-safety[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]test-cost: make just test-cost, check-full, and the CI Telemetry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test-cost job green and meaningful on master again, per the cost_budgets[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision (sase-j0).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Held staged handoffs from failed turns strand visibly[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]failed-turn-handoffs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after test-cost[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]failed-turn-handoffs: stop treating a never-started staged handoff from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an ended, failed turn as a live owner in sase-core, so its bead strands [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]visibly (sase-1sh).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Host-owned liveness for zombie epics[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]zombie-epics[dim] · [dim][/dim]after failed-turn-handoffs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]zombie-epics: detect in_progress plan beads whose children are all [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]closed and whose land agent is gone, report today's zombies, and recover[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per zombie_recovery (sase-12u).[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1vn","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1vn.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1vn.1"},"source_run_id":"run-036c3a49980984a11eb414bfb09ac104","started_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.856246+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[{"committed_at":1795794118,"sha":"f07962869753f885da90cb754bb8f282f51e36e7","subject":"fix: restore rebase-import certification and screenshot --window ownership"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"a22a5bb374276210edb48744915187128d9b6e2166a2ddf4e387c5e8b6740884","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vn.1--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":21869},"commits":{"digest":"a8675ac0935ce454b58baa495069d4f3533935f32862d6f105b795cd9bab6158","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vn.1--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":252},"meta":{"digest":"3569ed4171aa7e4d225e8fce09522038c374465d5b663630002d8770b29d237d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vn.1--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"state":{"digest":"9895c601dcaec1adf8d7bb5e58a11126573ac308e5ba929eaa8a040e9c64a73c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1vn.1--mon/sta